個人或一件事，就先有固定、不公平的看法。","n":28,"ssz":"....11..1..................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隱蔽","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不易被發現或察覺。","n":9,"ssz":"1........"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"屢見不鮮","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經常看到，並不新奇。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"滲透","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"液體在物體中慢慢穿透的現象，用以比喻思想或勢力逐漸侵入或影響其他領域。","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"日積月累","n":4,"ssz":"...1"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隨著時間一天天過去，經歷長時間的累積。","n":19,"ssz":"................1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"無傷大雅","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指事情雖有些錯誤或不完美，但影響不大。","n":19,"ssz":"................1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"憐憫","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看見別人弱小、困苦或不幸，而產生同情。","n":19,"ssz":"..........1........"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"刻板印象","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對某一群人形成固定、簡化的看法，忽略每個人的差異。例如：認為原住民同學一定能歌善舞。","n":42,"ssz":"...................1...............1......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內化","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"將外界的觀念逐漸吸收並轉變成自己的想法和態度。","n":23,"ssz":"...................1..."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這份報告只有幾個小錯字，不影響整體內容，應該（　）。","n":26,"ssz":".......1.................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"日本動漫和遊戲逐漸（　）到日常生活，改變了年輕人的價值觀。","n":29,"ssz":"....1........................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"含糖飲料看似安全，但（　）後，會對身體產生長遠的傷害。","n":27,"ssz":".....................1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經過一次次練習，他逐漸把教練教的技能（　）成自己的能力。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比賽中因為緊張而失誤的情形（　），選手必須學會調整心情。","n":28,"ssz":"....1......................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們不應該根據他黑壯的外表，就帶著（　）說他會很粗魯。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這條小路藏在樹林後方，位置十分（　），外地人很難發現。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到流浪狗在雨中發抖，她心生（　），便拿出毛巾幫牠擦乾。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列語詞，何者使用錯誤？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"模範生的她偶爾犯錯，被老師罵的場景「屢見不鮮」","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他偶爾說話失禮，大家都覺得「無傷大雅」，沒必要太過在意","n":27,"ssz":"............1.............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她靠著「日積月累」的練習，終於在舉重比賽中獲勝","n":23,"ssz":".......1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這間小店位置「隱蔽」，第一次來的人很難發現","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為什麼老師每次都讓體育班學生搬桌椅，可能構成微歧視？","n":26,"ssz":"1........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為老師可能忽略了其他班學生也可以搬桌椅的能力","n":23,"ssz":".1....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為老師只根據體育班身分，認為他們最適合體力勞動","n":24,"ssz":".1.........1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為體育班學生只有喝飲料就願意幫忙老師搬桌椅","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為老師不喜歡體育班的學生，故意使喚他們勞動","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項何者最能表達本文的主旨？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"微歧視看似事小，實則影響深遠，應反思言行促成多元接納","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"微歧視是一種社會問題，應立法制止防治、處罰此類行為","n":25,"ssz":"....2...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"弱勢群體需要被大家保護，讓他們不再被歧視","n":20,"ssz":"...............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大眾應多關注社會問題，並尋求公平解決方案","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"要破除微歧視，何者不是正確的方法？","n":17,"ssz":".........1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"時常反思自己的思維模式","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"要留意自己脫口而出的話語","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"被微歧視時可直接溫和溝通","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可減少與他人的交談","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列情境敘述中，哪一項符合「微歧視」現象？","n":21,"ssz":".........1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在公司裡，所有員工都必須參加安全培訓，無論其背景如何","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每年學校都會舉辦運動會，鼓勵所有學生參與各項比賽","n":24,"ssz":"...................1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對轉學生說：「你從臺東來的，你會搭臺北的公車捷運嗎？」","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師在課堂上鼓勵學生提出不同的意見和觀點","n":20,"ssz":".................1.."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜220字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"221~250字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞251字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（六    )開始朗讀，在表格中記錄1分鐘的朗讀字數。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以多練幾次。最後一次，找一位同學，請他計時、記錄並簽名！","n":84,"ssz":"....................................................................1..............."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這些看似平常的小事，就是「微歧視」。微歧視的「微","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE，本節 7 個）與橘色手寫字，PDF p5~p7 可見","n":52,"ssz":"...................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看完了本課，我們知道，微歧視常常不是故意的，卻可能藏著刻板印象或偏見。這些話看似沒什麼，卻可能讓人不舒服或受傷。\n例如：「你是原住民，應該很會唱歌喔？」、「你是體育班，搬重的東西一定沒問題吧！」「女生找個好老公比找個好工作重要吧！」這些話可能沒有惡意，但如果只因對方屬於某個群體，就替他預設能力、個性或生活方式，便可能形成微歧視。\n為了避免這樣尷尬的情形發生，從日常生活中，我們可以培養個人的覺察能力，學習如何正面應對微歧視！底下是一些練習！","n":221,"ssz":"................1........................................................1...............1..............................................1.............................1........................................1........2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看完了本課，我們知道，微歧視常常不是故意的，卻可能藏著刻板印象或偏見。這些話看似沒什麼，卻可能讓人不舒服或受傷。","n":56,"ssz":"................1......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例如：「你是原住民，應該很會唱歌喔？」、「你是體育班，搬重的東西一定沒問題吧！」「女生找個好老公比找個好工作重要吧！」這些話可能沒有惡意，但如果只因對方屬於某個群體，就替他預設能力、個性或生活方式，便可能形成微歧視。","n":108,"ssz":"................1...............1..............................................1............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了避免這樣尷尬的情形發生，從日常生活中，我們可以培養個人的覺察能力，學習如何正面應對微歧視！底下是一些練習！","n":55,"ssz":"1........................................1........2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小叮嚀：刻板印象或對某族群體的偏見，很可能就是微歧視。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 小試身手","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、辨識微歧視：","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請判斷下列情況是否為微歧視，是微歧視的打Ｖ。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對女生說：「你這麼漂亮，面試絕對大大加分。」","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對同學說：「你上次接力跑得很快，這次還想參加嗎？」","n":25,"ssz":"............1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你是原住民？那運動會全看你表現了！","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對身障者說：「你這樣還來上學，大家應該跟你看齊。」","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對新朋友說：「你平常喜歡做什麼運動？」","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對同性戀的朋友說：「同性戀的藝術細胞是不是都比較好？」","n":27,"ssz":"...................1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE），每列左欄一格","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、處理微歧視：","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果是你遭遇微歧視，可以怎麼反應？(可以的打Ｖ；可參考課文末段作答）","n":34,"ssz":"...............1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"溫和的表達自己當下的感受：「你這樣講，我感覺不舒服」。","n":27,"ssz":"...